          "ruleId": "EG011",
          "ruleIndex": 10,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "positive/deploy/compose.prod.yaml interpolates ${PROD_ONLY}, but there is no positive/deploy/.env next to it and it is not declared in positive/.env.example\n\nWhy: Compose substitutes an empty string for an unset PROD_ONLY and only prints a warning, so the container starts with a broken value.\n\nFix: Create positive/deploy/.env with `PROD_ONLY=\u003cvalue\u003e` (Compose reads it automatically), declare `PROD_ONLY=` in a template so others know to set it, or give it a default: `${PROD_ONLY:-value}`."
          },
